  "EditorMetadata": {
    "Description": "Q43-A2\u0027 - a parameter resolver authored AS A BLUEPRINT. A Library asset whose only graph is a Construction graph (\u0027runs once at setup\u0027), which the compiler emits as a pure static method and the registrar publishes in BlueprintDefinition.Resolvers. It takes MoveToLocationParams in and returns it REFINED (Q43-D): the authored Speed is in km/h, the usable Speed is in m/s, so the graph breaks the DTO, scales Speed by 1/3.6 and copies the struct with that one member overwritten - X/Y/ArrivalRadius are left unwired and therefore preserved. Nothing here writes anything outside the value it returns, which is what V_ResolverPurity (BP1675) enforces.",
    "Category": "Demo",
    "Recipe": null
  }
